  (6)

atha ṣaṣṭhaḥ skandhaḥ

sampūrṇaḥ

 oṃ śrīrādhāgokulānandābhyāṃ namaḥ

 (6.1)

  prathamo'dhyāyaḥ

  ajāmilopākhyāne śrīviṣṇuyamapuruṣasaṃvādaḥ

 || 6.1.1 ||

śrīparīkṣid uvāca—

  nivṛttimārgaḥ kathita ādau bhagavatā yathā |

  kramayogopalabdhena brahmaṇā yad asaṃsṛtiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :

puṇyāraṇye nṛsiṃhaika nāmasiṃho virājate |

  yannādataḥ palāyante mahākalmaṣakuñjarāḥ ||

visargasaṃbhavān jīvān svamaryādāsu saṃsthitān |

 viṣṇuḥ pātyākhilai rūpair ity evaṃ pañcame sthitam ||

adhyāyaikonaviṃśatyā ṣaṣṭhe poṣaṇam ucyate |

 atilaṅghitamaryāda bhaktarakṣaṇalakṣaṇam ||

 ajāmilo manuṣyeṣu mahāpāpo yathā'vitaḥ |

viśvarūpādighātī ca yathā deveṣu vāsavaḥ ||

  ajāmilasya bhaktatvaṃ viṣṇudūtair nirūpitam |

 saṃketabhagavannāma putrasnehānuṣaṅgajam ||

indro'pi bhagavadbhaktaḥ sakhyenopendrasevakaḥ |

 tadadhīnasuraiśvarya śatrunirjayajīvitaḥ ||

 tatrādau tribhir adhyāyair ajāmilakathocyate |

 viśvarūpakathā ṣaḍbhir indradoṣoktaye tataḥ ||

  indrasyaiva tu doṣoktyai vṛtrākhyānaṃ tato'ṣṭabhiḥ |

  dvābhyāṃ ca marudākhyānam evaṃ prakaraṇakramaḥ ||

 tatrādau prathame viṣṇor dūtaiḥ pātakimocane |

  tatpāpakhyāpanāyoktaṃ yāmyair dharmādilakṣaṇam ||

atha ṣaṣṭhaskandho vyākhyāyate | pūrvoktānuvādapūrvakaṃ
nirantaroktanarakaparihāropāyaṃ pṛcchati—nivṛttimārga iti ṣaḍbhiḥ |
ādau dvitīyaskandhe vaiśvānaraṃ yātī [bhā.pu. 2.2.24] ity ādinā |
bhagavatā tvayā | yathā yathāvat | udyena mārgeṇa | krameṇa yogo'rcir
ādiprāptis tenopalabdho brahma tena sahāsaṃsṛtir mokṣo bhavati |

brahmaṇo saha te sarve saṃprāpte pratisaṃcare |

parasyānte kṛtātmānaḥ praviśanti paraṃ padam || iti vacanāt |

kramasandarbhaḥ :

ṣaṣṭhasya kramasandarbhe sandarbhāṇāṃ samāhṛtiḥ |

 kriyate yan nideśena sa me'nanyagater gatiḥ ||

 atha ṣaṣṭhaskandhasya kramasandarbhaḥ |

  svāmipādair na yad vyaktaṃ yad vyaktaṃ cāsphuṭaṃ kvacit |

tatra tatraiva lekhyo'yaṃ sandarbhaḥ kramasaṃjñakaḥ ||

vaiṣṇavaparitoṣaḥ syād yatra yatra tatas tataḥ |

  lekhyaṃ vaiṣṇavasiddhāntaṃ dākṣiṇyenaiva kiṃcana ||

praṣṭavyārthopayuktam eva tat pūrvoktam anuvadati—nivṛttīti pañcabhiḥ |
tatra paralokamārgau tāvad dvau—vedānusāreṇaikaḥ, tadatikrameṇānyaḥ |
prathamo'tra dvividhaḥ—nivṛttipravṛttilakṣaṇaḥ, uttaras tv
ekavidho'dharmalakṣaṇaḥ | atra mārgatvaṃ nāma kramayogahetutvam ity
uktam | kramayogopalabdhena iti | jñānabhaktī tu sadyaḥprāpakatvān
mārgatvena na vivakṣite | tad etad abhipretyāha—prathamasārdhadvayena |
tatra nivṛttīti yugmakam ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ : 

 oṃ namaḥ kṛṣṇāya |

 praṇamya śrīguruṃ bhūyaḥ śaktaṃ karuṇārṇavam |

lokanāthaṃ jagaccakṣuḥ śrīguruṃ tam upāśraye ||

goparāmājanaprāṇapreyaseti prabhuṣṇave |

  tadīyapriyadāsyāya māṃ madīyam ahaṃ dade ||

svamaryādātāpin yas tu pātāladivaukasām |

 pālanaṃ sthānaśabdoktaṃ pañcame tad udīritam ||

 bhaktānāṃ dharmamaryādollaṅghinām api pālanam |

  yad bhavet tat tu vidvadbhiḥ poṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitam ||

 pāpino'jāmilasyāpi nāmābhāsena bhaktatā |

 gurudroho'pi śakrasya proktādhikṛtabhaktatā ||

 tayoś ca poṣaṇāc citraketvādīnāṃ ca kiṃ punaḥ |

 adhyāyaikonaviṃśatyā bhaktavātsalyam ucyate ||

 ttra tu tribhir adhyāyaiḥ kathājāmilasaṃśrayā |

viśvarūpāśrayā ṣaḍbhir vṛtrākhyānam athāṣṭabhiḥ ||

marudākhyānam adhyāyadvayena parikīrtitam |

 yatrānuvṛttir indreṇa dityāṃ puṃsavanavrate ||

  tatrehaprathame'dhyāye viṣṇudūtair ajāmile |

 mocyamāne tadīyād yāny ucyante yamakiṃkaraiḥ ||

narāṇāṃ narakapātayātanāśravaṇena dayārdrahṛdayas tannistāropāyasya
praṣṭavyasya pratyuttaravacanayogyatāyām utsāham upapādayituṃ
pūrvoktānuvādena upadiṣṭārthāvadhāraṇayogyatāṃ
svasyābhivyañjayati—nivṛttīti | yathā yathāvat | ādau
dvitīyaskandhe—vaiśvānaraṃ yāti [bhā.pu. 2.2.24] ity ādinā, tathā tṛtīye
ca—ye svadharmān na duhyanti [bhā.pu. 3.32.5] ity ādinā yat yena mārgeṇa
kramayogena prāpto yo brahmā tena saha asaṃsṛtir mokṣo bhavati |

brahmaṇā saha te sarve samprāpte pratisaṃcare |

parasyānte kṛtātmānaḥ praviśanti paraṃ padam || iti śruteḥ ||1||

