 || 6.1.9 ||

śrīrājovāca—

  dṛṣṭaśrutābhyāṃ yat pāpaṃ jānann apy ātmano'hitam |

 karoti bhūyo vivaśaḥ prāyaścittam atho katham ||

śrīdharaḥ :  atra codayati dvābhyām | dṛṣṭaṃ rājadaṇḍādi | śrutaṃ
narakapātādi | tābhyām ātmanaḥ pāpam ahitaṃ jānann api bhūyaḥ
prāyaścittānantaraṃ karoti | atho ataḥ kāraṇād dvādaśābdādi kathaṃ
prāyaścittam | tena samūlasya doṣasyānivṛtteḥ | nivṛttau vā punaś ca
pāpaprarohāyogād iti bhāvaḥ ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tathaiva pṛcchati—dṛṣṭeti ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ :  madam idam ākṣipann asan manyamāna āha—dṛṣṭeti dvābhyām |
dṛṣṭaṃ rājadaṇḍādi śrutaṃ narakapātādi tābhyām ātmano'hitaṃ pāpaṃ
prāyaścittānantaraṃ karoti | loke tathā dṛṣṭatvād ity arthaḥ | atho ataḥ
prāyaścittaṃ kathaṃ pāpanāśakam ity arthaḥ | tasya pāpanāśakatve punaḥ
pāpaprarohāyogād iti bhāvaḥ ||9||

