atra samūlasāṅgāśeṣapāpanāśo'bhipretaḥ | pūrvaṃ ca analo veṇugulmam
iveti analasya bhūmyantargatadahanāśaktyā bhasmāder api vidyamānatayā
samūlāśeṣapāpanivṛttir uktā | evam api pūrvato'sya viśeṣo'vagantavyaḥ
