 || 6.2.12 ||

 naikāntikaṃ tad dhi kṛte'pi niṣkṛte

 manaḥ punar dhāvati ced asatpathe |

 tat karmanirhāram abhīpsatāṃ harer

 guṇānuvādaḥ khalu sattvabhāvanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : naikāntikaṃ nātyantaśodhakam | tan niṣkṛtam | yasmin kṛte'py
asatpathe pāpamārge mano dhāvati cet | karmaṇāṃ pāpānāṃ nirhāram
ātyantikaṃ nāśam icchatāṃ harer guṇānuvāda eva prāyaścittam | yato'sau
khalu sattvabhāvanaś cittaśodhakaḥ ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na kevalaṃ nāmaiva tādṛk, kintu guṇā apīty
āhuḥ—naikāntikam iti | guṇānām anuvādo'pi ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ :  dvādaśābdādiprāyaścittānāṃ tato nikṛṣṭatvam
āhuḥ—naikāntikaṃ nātyantaśodhakam | tat prāyaścittam | yasmin kṛte'py
asatpathe pāpamārge mano dhāvati cet, tasmāt nirhāram ātyantikaṃ nāśam
abhīpsatāṃ harer guṇānuvādo nāmnām iva guṇānām apy anuvādo'nukathanaṃ
kasyacin mukhāt śrutānāṃ teṣāṃ paścātkathanaṃ, paścāt sādṛśyayor anu ity
amaraḥ | sattvabhāvano vāsanāyā api nāśakatvāt sattvaśodhakaḥ |

nanu manaḥ punar dhāvatīti prāyaścittānantaraṃ punaḥ pāpakaraṇaṃ kathaṃ
nindyate tasyāpi saṃskārādhīnatvād utkhātadaṃṣṭror agadaṃśasadṛśatvam
asmābhir vyākhyeyam iti cet, bhrāntāḥ sthaḥ, tathā vyākhyānam asmākaṃ
nāmnaḥ savāsanapāpanāśakatvapratipādakavacanānurodhād eva, na tu
svakapolakalpitam | bhavatāṃ tu prāyaścittaśāstre tādṛśavacanābhāvāt
karmamārge hy arthavādajanyapratyavāyasyāpy aśravaṇāt kathaṃ tathā
vyākhyātuṃ śaktir iti prāg evoktam ||12||

