 || 6.2.15 ||

patitaḥ skhalito bhagnaḥ sandaṣṭas tapta āhataḥ |

harir ity avaśenāha pumān nārhati yātanāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu nāyaṃ saṃkalpapūrvakaṃ vaikuṇṭhanāmāgrahīt, kintu
putrasnehaparavaśaḥ san, tatrāhuḥ—patita iti | avaśenāpi yo harir ity
āha sa yātanāṃ nārhati | pumān ity anena nātra varṇāśramādiniyama ity
uktam | avaśatvam evāhuḥ—patitaḥ prāsādādibhyaḥ | skhalito mārge | bhagno
bhagnagātraḥ | sandaṣṭaḥ sarpādibhiḥ | tapto jvarādinā | āhato daṇḍādinā
||15||

sanātanaḥ (ha.bha.vi. 11.336) : nanu nāyaṃ saṃkalpapūrvakaṃ
