 || 6.2.17 ||

 tais tāny aghāni pūyante tapodānavratādibhiḥ |

nādharmajaṃ taddhṛdayaṃ tad apīśāṅghrisevayā ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca tais tapodānādibhis tāny aghāny eva pūyante naśyanti |
adharmāj jātaṃ malinaṃ tu tasya pāpakartur hṛdayam | yadvā teṣām aghānāṃ
hṛdayaṃ sūkṣmaṃ rūpaṃ saṃskārākhyaṃ na śudhyati | tad apīśāṅghrisevayāṃ
kīrtanādinā śudhyatīty arthaḥ | ayaṃ bhāvaḥ—mahānty api pāpāni sakṛd
uccāritenaiva nāmnā naśyanti | sakṛt pravartitena dīpeneva gāḍhadhvāntāni
| tadāvṛttyā tu pāpāntarasyānutpattiḥ | dīpadhāraṇa iva tamo'ntarasya |
tataś ca vāsanākṣayād dhṛdayaśuddhiḥ | etadartham eva tatra
tatrāvṛttividhānam | pāpakṣayaś ca bhavati smaratāṃ tam aharniśam
