śrīdharaḥ : nanu nāmābhāsena kathaṃ sarvapāpakṣayaḥ syāt ?
śraddhābhaktyāvṛttyāder api vidhānāt | tathā hi—sāyaṃ prātar gṛṇan
bhaktyā duḥkhagrāmād vimucyate [bhā.pu. 1.3.29] iti, anudinam idam
ādareṇa śṛṇvan [bhā.pu. 4.23.39] iti,

śravaṇaṃ kīrtanaṃ dhyānaṃ harer adbhutakarmaṇaḥ |

janmakarmaguṇānāṃ ca tad arthe'khilaceṣṭitam || [bhā.pu. 11.3.27]

ityādy asminn eva purāṇe tatra tatra paṭhyate | purāṇāntare ca,
pāpakṣayaś ca bhavati smaratāṃ tam aharniśam iti | atraiva ca,

tasmāt saṃkīrtanaṃ viṣṇor jaganmaṅgalam aṃhasām |

mahatām api kauravya viddhy ekāntikaniṣkṛtam || [bhā.pu. 6.3.31]

ityādinā samyak kīrtanād eva mucyate |

kiṃ ca, tathā sati kim iti manvādayo dvādaśābdādīni smareyuḥ | tasmād
idam anupapannam iva tan nāha—etāvateti | bhagavato guṇānāṃ karmaṇāṃ ca
nāmnāṃ ca samyak kīrtanam iti yad etāvatā puṃsām aghanirharaṇāya
pāpakṣayamātrāyālam upayogo nāsti | alaṃśabdo'tra vāṛaṇe |
yathāhāmarasiṃhaḥ, alaṃ bhūṣaṇaparyāptiśaktivāraṇavācakam iti |

upayogābhāvam evāha | ajāmilo mahapātaky api nārāyaṇeti vikruśya, na tu
samyak kīrtayitvā | tac ca putraṃ vikruśya, na tu harim | aghavān aśucir
api mriyamāṇo'svasthacitto'pi muktim avāpa, na tv aghanirharaṇamātram |
ato nāmābhāsenāpi sarvapāpakṣaya ity eva tattvam |
āvṛttiśraddhādividhayas tu pāpavāsanākṣayārthā ity uktam eva, harer
guṇānuvādaḥ khalu sattvabhāvanaḥ ity atra ||24||

sanātanaḥ (ha.bha.vi. 11.427) : bhagavato guṇānāṃ karmaṇāṃ ca nāmnāṃ ca |
yad vā, guṇakarmasambandhināṃ vicitrāṇāṃ nāmnāṃ bahūnāṃ samyak kīrtanaṃ
puṃsām aghanirharaṇāya pāpakṣayamātrāya bhavatīti yat, etāvatā uktena
alaṃ prayojanaṃ nāsti | kutaḥ ? ajāmilo mahapātaky api nārāyaṇety eva
vikruśya, na tv avatārasambandhiguṇakarmamādhurīvaiśiṣṭyaṃ
nāmaviśeṣaṃ samyak kīrtayitvā | tatra ca putraṃ vikruśya, na tu harim |
aghavān aśucir api akṛtaprāyaścitto'pīti vā | mriyamāṇo'svasthacitto'pi
muktim avāpa, na tv aghanirharaṇamātram | tadānīm ajāmilasya dehasya
vartamānatvena jīvanmuktataiva siddhā | ato nāmābhāsenāpi yathākathañcij
jātena muktir api syāt | kim uta pāpakṣaya iti bhāvaḥ ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : etāvatety asya ṭīkāyāṃ pāpavāsanākṣayārthā ity atra
tathāpi mahadaparādhādyālambanena tiṣṭhati yā pāpavāsanā tasyāḥ
kṣayārthā ity arthaḥ | maraṇe tu niraparādhasyaiva sato mukhe
nāmāvirbhāvaḥ syād iti bhāvaḥ | ittham eva dvitīye etāvān
sāṃkhyayogābhyāṃ [bhā.pu. 2.1.6] ity atra vyākhyātam | ante tu paramo
lābha iti | tad uktam—

kṛṣṇaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ kṛṣṇa ity antakāle

jalpan jantur jīvitaṃ yo jahāti |

ādyaḥ śabdaḥ kalpate tasya muktyai

vrīḍānamrau tiṣṭhato'nyāvṛṇasthau || iti |

muktim iyāteti jīvanmuktyapekṣayā ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu sakṛd uccāritenaiva nāmābhāsena kathaṃ
sarvapāpakṣayaḥ tannāmagrahaṇādibhir iti tvayāpy ādipadopadānāt
kīrtanaśravaṇādyaṅgabhaktiyogena paramadharmeṇa
sarvapāpakṣayapūrvakamokṣaprāptir ity uktatvād ity ata āha—etāvateti
| bhagavato guṇānāṃ karmaṇāṃ nāmnāṃ ca samyak kīrtanam ity etāvatā puṃsām
aghanirharaṇāya pāpakṣayamātrāyālam upayogo nāsti | alaṃśabdo'tra
vāṛaṇe, nāmādīnām ekatarasyāpi asamyakkīrtanād api
sāghanirharaṇasiddher iti bhāvaḥ | yad yato vikruśyaiva, na tu samyak
kīrtayitvā | tac ca nārāyaṇāyeti nāmnā putraṃ vikruśya, na tu harim |
aghavān aśucir api, na tu śuciḥ san ajāmilo'py atiprasiddhamahāpātaky
api, na tv anyaḥ kṣudrapāpī | mriyamāṇo maraṇaduḥkhavivaśo'pi, na tu
susthacittaḥ muktim iyāya prāpa, na tu pāpanirharaṇamātram | tasmāt
tannāmagrahaṇādibhir iti—

śravaṇaṃ kīrtanaṃ dhyānaṃ harer adbhutakarmaṇaḥ |

janmakarmaguṇānāṃ ca tad arthe'khilaceṣṭitam || [bhā.pu. 11.3.27]

tasmāt saṃkīrtanaṃ viṣṇor [bhā.pu. 6.3.31] iti, anudinam idam ādareṇa
śṛṇvan [bhā.pu. 4.23.39] ity ādiṣu bhakter anekeṣām aṅgānāṃ
śraddhāvṛttisamyaktvāder api yad vidhānaṃ tan niraparādhānāṃ
premavṛddhyartham | nāmāparādhavatāṃ tu nāmāparādhakṣayārthaṃ ca |
śraddhāmṛtakathāyāṃ me [bhā.pu. 11.19.20] ity upakramya,

evaṃ dharmair manuṣyāṇām uddhavātmani vedinām |

mayi sañjāyate bhaktiḥ ko'nyo'rtho'syāvaśiṣyate || [bhā.pu. 11.19.24] iti
|

atra bhaktiśabdena premaivoktaḥ | ko'nya ity anena mokṣasya nirākaraṇāt—

nāmāparādhayuktānāṃ nāmāny eva haranty agham |

aviśrāntaprayuktāni tāny evārthakarāṇi ca ||  iti |

pāpakṣayaś ca, bhavati smaratāntam aharniśam ity atra cakārān
