vaitānike mahati karmaṇi yujyamānaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : yat tūktaṃ vyarthaṃ tarhi dvādaśābdādismaraṇam iti
tatrāḥa—prāyeṇeti | mahājano manvādiḥ | ayaṃ
bhavaḥ—yathāmṛtasañjīvanauṣadhim ajānanto vaidyā roganirharaṇāya
trikaṭukanimbādīni smaranti, tathā
svayaṃbhūśaṃbhupramukhadvādaśavyatirekeṇāyaṃ mahājano'tiguhyam idam
ajñātvā dvādaśābdādikaṃ smaratīti |

kiṃ ca, māyayā devyā alaṃ vimohitamatir ayaṃ jano madhu madhuraṃ yathā
bhavati, evaṃ puṣpitāyāṃ puṣpasthānīyair arthavādair manoharāyāṃ trayyāṃ
jaḍīkṛtā abhiniviṣṭā matir yasya | ato mahaty eva karmaṇi śraddhayā
yujyamāno nālpe pravartate | dṛśyate hi prākṛtasya lokasya mahati
mantrādau śraddhā, alpe cāśraddhā | tasmād asya grāhako nāstīti tair
noktam |

yad vā, svādhīnaḥ siṃho'sty etāvatā śvaśṛgālādinivāraṇāya taṃ yathā na
prayuñjate, tathātitucchatvāt pāpasya na tannirasanāya paramamaṅgalaṃ
harer nāma smaranti |

yad vā, nāmamāhātmyajñāne sarvamuktiprasaṅgād ity eṣā dik |
granthavistarabhayāt tu nātiprapañcyate ||25||

caitanyamatamañjuṣā : nanu satsu bhagavannāmagrahaṇādiṣu kathaṃ nāma
kṛcchracāndrāyaṇādir mahājanair nirūpitaḥ ? nety āha—prāyeṇa vedetyādi
| mahājano vyāsayājñavalkyādiḥ | svayambhūr ityādidvādaśabhinnaḥ |
prāyeṇa sākalyena yāthārthyena vā veda | kutaḥ ? tatrāha—devyā māyayā
viśeṣeṇa mohitaḥ | liṅgam āha—trayyāṃ jaḍīkṛtamatiḥ, yatas tayaiva
yujyamānaḥ, na tu yojitaḥ ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : mahājano dvādaśetaramunyādiḥ | sa eva devyā
vimohitamatir ityādilakṣaṇaḥ ||25||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv evam akhiladharmaśreṣṭhaṃ muktisādhanam atisugamaṃ
