karmayogam evopadiśanti, kurvate ca ? tatrāha—prāyeṇeti | mahājano
jaiminyādir idaṃ na veda |

nanu śāstrakṛt kathaṃ na veda ? tatrāha—devyā paramaiśvaryā | aviduṣo
