evāha—mukundapādāravindayor makarandarūpo raso bhaktilakṣaṇas tasmād
vimukhān | kathaṃbhūtān ? rasajñair bhaktisukhābhijñaiḥ rasavivekibhir
vā paramahaṃsakulaiḥ, ata eva niṣkiñcanair abhimānaśūnyair nirapekṣair
vā, ajasraṃ juṣṭān sevitān | yad vā, ajasraṃ vimukhān iti sambandhaḥ |
