 || 6.3.30 ||

  tat kṣamyatāṃ sa bhagavān puruṣaḥ purāṇo

nārāyaṇaḥ svapuruṣair yad asat kṛtaṃ naḥ |

 svānām aho na viduṣāṃ racitāñjalīnāṃ

 kṣāntir garīyasi namaḥ puruṣāya bhūmne  ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhagavantaṃ kṣamāpayati—tad iti | ayaṃ bhāvaḥ—naḥ svapuruṣair
asmadīyatvena sthitaiḥ svīyair eva puruṣair yad yasmād asad anyāyyaṃ kṛtaṃ
tat tasmāt svayam eva kṣamyatāṃ sahatām | svānāṃ svīyānāṃ bhaktānāṃ
no'smākaṃ na viduṣām ajñānām | aho garīyasi tasmin kṣāntir yuktaiva | maha
iti pāṭhe svīyānāṃ māhātmyam aviduṣāṃ naḥ kṣamāṃ karotv ity arthaḥ ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svapuruṣair dvārabhūtair yan no'smābhir asatkṛtam
