viśvanāthaḥ : bhṛtyāparādhe svāmino daṇḍaḥ iti nyāyena svasyāparādhitvaṃ
bhāvayan savinayaṃ praṇamati—tat tasmāt kṣamyatu, naḥ svapuruṣaiḥ suṣṭhu
apuruṣaiḥ kupuruṣair ity arthaḥ | asat anyāyyaṃ kṛtaṃ, na kīdṛśānāṃ svānāṃ
tat kiṃkarāṇām | aho ity āścarye | tad api na viduṣām ato'jñatvād eva
racitāñjalīnām |

nanu daṇḍayitum asamarthā eva kṣamante ? tatrāha—kṣāntir garīyasi
mahāmahattame tad api kṣamaiva yuktā | svānāṃ mahaḥ iti pāṭhe
viṣṇudūtānāṃ yan maho māhātmyaṃ tad ajānatām ||30||

