śrīdharaḥ : parāya sarvottamāya namo dadhe namanaṃ karomi | paratve
hetuḥ—avitathā anubhūtiś cicchaktir yasya | ato guṇatrayābhāso jīvo
nimittaṃ māyā ca tayor bandhave niyantre | evam api guṇeṣu tattvabuddhir
yeṣāṃ tair jīvair adṛṣṭaṃ dhāma svarūpaṃ yasya | tatra hetuḥ, nivṛttaṃ
mānaṃ yasmāt | pāṭhāntare nivṛttaṃ nirastaṃ mānam avadhiś ca yasmāt |
tarhi kathaṃ tasya siddhiḥ ? ata āha | svayambhuve svaprakāśāya ||23||

