tattvabuddhiḥ kāraṇajñānaṃ yeṣāṃ tair adṛṣṭaṃ tarkayitum aśakyaṃ
kimutānubhavitum aśakyaṃ dhāma tādṛśaśaktiprakāśo'pi kim uta
svarūpatatpūrṇaśaktī yasya tasmai | sarvatra hetuḥ—svaprakāśāyeti |
guṇatrayasyābhāsaḥ svājñānenāropo yasmin sa jīva iti | jīvasya
