  || 6.4.2728 ||

manīṣiṇo'ntarhṛdi sanniveśitaṃ

  svaśaktibhir navabhiś ca trivṛdbhiḥ |

vahniṃ yathā dāruṇi pāñcadaśyaṃ

 manīṣayā niṣkarṣanti gūḍham ||

  sa vai mamāśeṣaviśeṣamāyā

niṣedhanirvāṇasukhānubhūtiḥ |

sa sarvanāmā sa ca viśvarūpaḥ

prasīdatām aniruktātmaśaktiḥ ||

madhvaḥ: icchādirūpeṇa trivṛdbhiḥ |

icchāditvena trividhā vimalādyās tu śaktayaḥ |

viṣṇoḥ svarūpabhūtāyās tābhyas tannāmikāḥ parāḥ ||

jāyante tatprasādena tāś ca pīṭhe prapūjayet |

tadbhinnajīvās tasyaiva prasādāt tāḥ samīpagāḥ || iti  tattvanirṇaye |

daśendriyāṇi ca manobuddhiprāṇapradhānakāḥ |

caturdeśaiṣāṃ paramaḥ pāñcadaśyo hariḥ smṛtaḥ |

buddher bhedena caiteṣu pāñcadaśyo'tha saṃsthiteḥ || iti ca |

iyattā tu viśeṣaḥ syād ānandādau tadujjhiteḥ |

sarvair viśeṣai rahita ucyate harir avyayaḥ |

aprākṛtasvarūpatvān nirmāyaś ceti kathyate || iti ca |

tadrūpasadṛśaṃ rūpaṃ yataḥ sarvasya sarvadā |

sarvarūpo yataḥ śabdamukhyārthaḥ sarvanāmakaḥ || iti ca |

alaukikatvān no viṣṇur nirukto'to nirūpitaḥ |

tathāpi vedeṣūktatvād ukto rūpī sa eva ca || iti vyomasaṃhitāyām
||2728||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃbhūtaḥ keṣāṃ pratīyata ity apekṣāyām āha—manīṣiṇa iti
dvābhyām | vivekino yaṃ niṣkarṣanti vivicya dhyāyanti, sa
nirvāṇasukhānubhūtir mama prasīdatām iti dvayor anvayaḥ | evaṃ niṣkarṣatā
pratīyata iti bhāvaḥ | kim ? iti niṣkarṣanti | svaśaktibhir gūḍham
aprakāśamānam | katibhir navabhiḥ ? punaś ca trivṛdbhiḥ triguṇābhiḥ
saptaviṃśaty upādhibhir gūḍham aṣṭāviṃśaṃ niṣkarṣantīty arthaḥ |

yad vā, navabhiḥ prakṛtipuruṣamahadahaṃkārapañca tanmātrarūpābhiḥ |
trivṛdbhis triguṇātmikābhiḥ | cakārāt ṣoḍaśavikārarūpābhiś ca |
kathaṃbhūtaṃ niṣkarṣanti ? manīṣayāntarhṛdi sanniveśitaṃ niścalīkṛtaṃ
pāñcadaśyaṃ pañcadaśasāmidhenīmantraiḥ prakāśyam alaukikaṃ vahnim
ivāhaṃkārāspadād ātmano'nyaṃ paramātmānaṃ niṣkarṣantīty arthaḥ ||27||

aśeṣā viśeṣā yasyās tasyā māyāyā niṣedhena nivārṇasukhe'nubhūtir yasya
aprasaktaniṣedhāsaṃbhavāt prasaktim āha | sa eva sarvanāmā, sa eva
viśvarūpa iti | tadrūpatve'pi vāstavatvābhāvān niṣedhaḥ saṃbhavatīty āha
| aniruktā ātmani śaktir māyā yasya saḥ ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : manīṣiṇa iti yugmakam | trivṛn navaśaktyatītatve sati
kathaṃ svato niḥśaktika evāham ? nety āha—aśeṣeti | anubhūtir avaśyaṃ
mantavyā tāṃ vinā puruṣārthatvāsiddheḥ | tasyāṃ ca mantavyāyāṃ
tallakṣaṇākhaṇḍāpi svarūpaśaktiḥ siddhyaty eveti bhāvaḥ |
tathaivāha—prasīdatām iti | nanu tābhyo niṣkṛṣṭaś cet kathaṃ
tanmayasarvanāmarūpaḥ ? tatrāha—anirukteti | acintyaśaktitvād ity
arthaḥ ||27||

nanu mama yan nirvāṇasukhaikarūpaṃ brahmākhyaṃ svarūpaṃ, tasyānubhūtikam
eva bhavatīti trivṛn navaśāktikaṃ bhavatu | yat tu guṇarūpabṛṃhitaṃ
svarūpaṃ, tat tu tanmayam eva bhavet, jagatsādṛśyāt ? tatrāha—yad yad iti
trikeṇa | guṇai rūpaiś ca bṛṃhitam asamo'rddhabṛhattamaṃ yat svarūpaṃ,
tad api | vacādigocaro yad yad vastu, tan na bhavati | tatra hetuḥ—sa vā
iti | saguṇarūpabṛṃhitasvarūpas tvaṃ guṇapralayasṛṣṭibhyāṃ lakṣyate
tarkyata eva, na tv anubhūyata iti |

yad vā, guṇānām apāyo'pagamo yasmāt tasmin vigatasarge nityasiddhe
vaikuṇṭhe lakṣyate tadadhiṣṭhātṛtvena dṛśyata iti ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : durvijñeyaṃ saviśeṣasvarūpam āha—manīṣiṇaḥ śuddhabhaktāḥ
gūḍham antar hṛdi saṃniveśitaṃ, praviṣṭaḥ karṇarandhreṇa svānāṃ
bhāvasaroruhaṃ [bhā.pu. 2.8.5] ityuktarītyā śravaṇabhaktyā antar hṛdi
praveśitam | punar manīṣayā premabhaktyākhyayā niṣkarṣanti |
antarhṛdayān niṣkṛṣya cakṣurādibhir indriyaiḥ saundaryādimādhuryam
āsvādayantīty arthaḥ |

kīdṛśaṃ santam ? niṣkarṣanti svaśaktibhiś cicchaktibhiḥ sahitam |
katibhiḥ ? navabhir vimalādyābhis tatrāpi trivṛdbhiś cicchakter eva
tisṛbhir vṛttibhiḥ hlādinīsandhinīsaṃvidhbiś ca sahitam | yad uktaṃ
viṣṇupurāṇe—

hlādinī sandhinī saṃvit  tvayy ekā sarvasaṃsthitau |

hlādatāpakarī miśrā  tvayi no guṇavarjite || [vi.pu. 1.12.68] iti |

yathā dāruṇi kāṣṭhe pāñcadaśyaṃ pañcadaśasāmidhenīmantraiḥ prakāśyam
alaukikaṃ vahniṃ niṣkarṣanti, sa prasīdatām ity uttareṇānvayaḥ | asya
saviśeṣasvarūpasyāprakṛtānantaguṇasya durvijñeyatvaṃ bhaktihīnair
anubhavitum aśakyatvāt bhaktair anubhūyamānatve'pi mādhuryaiśvaryayoḥ
pārājñānāt | yad uktaṃ brahmaṇaiva—

guṇātmanas te'pi guṇān vimātuṃ

hitāvatīrṇasya ka īśire'sya |

kālena yair vā vimitāḥ sukalpair

bhūpāṃśavaḥ khe mihikā dyubhāsaḥ  ||  [bhā.pu. 10.14.7] iti ||27||

yad bhūtasya māyikaṃ saviśeṣaṃ rūpaṃ tadvyatiriktam eva mamopāsyam ity
āha—sa mama prasīdatām | aśeṣā viśeṣā yasyās tasyā māyāyā niṣedhena yan
nirvāṇasukhaṃ, bāṇā hṛdvidārakā ādhyātmikādiduḥkhaśarāḥ ke'pi na santi
yatra, tasminn eva sukhe anubhūtir yasya saḥ—hlādatāpakarī miśrā  tvayi
no guṇavarjite || [vi.pu. 1.12.68] iti vaiṣṇavokteḥ |

aprasaktaniṣedhāsambhavāt prasaktim āha—sa eva sarvanāmā sa eva
viśvarūpa iti brahmāditṛṇāntānāṃ yāni nāmarūpāṇi tāni tasyaivety arthaḥ
| māyāyās tacchaktitvena māyaikaviśvasyāpi tadrūpatvāt tasya
svarūpabhūtā śaktis tu māyāśakter māyikād viśvasmāc cānyaivety
āha—aniruktā māyikavāṅmanasābhyām aniruktiviṣayībhūtā ātmabhūtā
śaktir yasya saḥ ||28||

