 || 6.4.29 ||

  yad yan niruktaṃ vacasā nirūpitaṃ

dhiyākṣabhir vā manasota yasya |

mā bhūt svarūpaṃ guṇarūpaṃ hi tat tat

 sa vai guṇāpāyavisargalakṣaṇaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu yadi kevalayā svasaṃsthayā pratīyate tarhi
sarvanāmatvaṃ viśvarūpatvaṃ cānupapannaṃ vāgādyagocaratvād ity āśaṅkya
sarvair nāmabhir vācyaṃ pratyakṣādidṛśyaṃ ca tasya svarūpaṃ vastuto
mābhūt tathāpi māyayā ghaṭata iti ślokatrayeṇopapādayan namaskaroti, yad
yad iti | yad yad vacasā niruktam abhihitaṃ dhiyā nirūpitaṃ vyavasitam
akṣabhir vā indriyair nirūpitaṃ gṛhītam uta api manasāpi nirūpitaṃ
saṃkalpitaṃ yasya svaprakāśatvaṃ tasya tat svarūpaṃ mā bhūt |
svarūpatvābhāve hetuḥ, hi yasmāt tat tad guṇānām eva rūpam | pāṭhāntare
guṇair vardhitam | sa tu guṇavyatiriktaḥ | yato guṇānām
apāyavisargābhyāṃ pralayotpattibhyāṃ lakṣyata iti tathā |
cetanādhiṣṭhānaṃ vinā tayor asaṃbhavāt | yad vā, yasya svarūpaṃ mā bhūn na
bhavati tasmai nama iti tṛtīyenānvayaḥ ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : vāgbuddhyādikaṃ tu sarvamāyikam eva, tena nirūpitam api
sarvaṃ māyikam eva bhavet | tat tu na tatsvarūpam āha—yad yad iti | yad
yad vacasā niruktam abhihitaṃ dhiyā nirūpitaṃ vyavasitam akṣabhir vā
indriyair nirūpitaṃ gṛhītam uta api manasāpi nirūpitaṃ saṃkalpitaṃ tat tat
sarvaṃ yasya svarūpaṃ mābhūt na bhavati | tasmai namaḥ iti tṛtīyenānvayaḥ
| hi yatas tadguṇānām eva rūpaṃ guṇabṛṃhitaṃ, hi tad iti pāṭhe, guṇair
vardhitaṃ sa tu guṇavyatirikta ity arthaḥ | yataḥ guṇānām
apāyavisargābhyāṃ pralayotpattibhyāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ yasya saḥ | yaḥ
sṛṣṭipralayau karoti sa īśvara ity ataḥ sṛṣṭeḥ pūrvatra pralayāt paratra
ca tasya sattvasiddheḥ | atra dṛśyate tv agryayā buddhyā iti, manasā
evānudraṣṭavyaḥ iti, tam eva viditvātimṛtyum eti [śve.u. 3.8] iti, ātmā vā
are draṣṭavyaḥ [bṛ.ā.u. 2.4.5] ityādi | tasmāt sarvātmanā rājan  hariḥ
sarvatra sarvadā śrotavyaḥ kīrtitavyaś ca  [bhā.pu. 2.2.36] iti
parasahasraśrutismṛtivākyavirodhād īśvarānanugṛhītair eva
vacāadibhir iti vyākhyeyam |

ataḥ śrīkṛṣṇanāmādi na bhaved grāhyam indriyaiḥ |

sevonmukhe hi jihvādau svayam eva sphuraty adaḥ || [bhaṛaṣi. 1.2.234]

ityādyuktavacanaṃ ca |

kecit tu kārtsnyena nirūpaṇābhāvān na nirūpitam ity āhuḥ—yato vāco
nivartante aprāpya manasā saha [tai.u. 2.4.1] ity atrāpādānanirdeśāt
vāṅmanasāgamyatvaṃ, nivartante iti antarlobhād vāṅmanasāgamyatvaṃ
cetivat ||29||

