 || 6.4.34 ||

 yaḥ prākṛtair jñānapathair janānāṃ

 yathāśayaṃ dehagato vibhāti |

  yathānilaḥ pārthivam āśrito guṇaṃ

  sa īśvaro me kurutāṃ manoratham ||

madhvaḥ : svadehasthaṃ hariṃ prāhur adhamā jīvam eva tu |

madhyamāś cāpy anirṇītaṃ jīvād bhinnaṃ janārdanam ||

pūrṇānandādiguṇakaṃ sarvajīvavilakṣaṇam |

uttamās tu hariṃ prāhus tāratamyena teṣu ca ||

buddhiśuddhyanusāreṇa yathāprāṇaṃ śarīragam |

śvāsamātraṃ janāḥ prāhur anirṇītaṃ ca madhyamāḥ |

devadeveśvaraṃ sūtram ānandaṃ prāṇavedinaḥ ||  iti ca ||34||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu tvādṛśāḥ sakāmā gaṇeśādīn prārthayante tvaṃ tu tān
vihāya kim iti bhagavantam eva prārthayase tatrāha | prākṛtair arvācīnair
jñānapathair upāsanāmārgair yathāśayaṃ tat tad vāsanānusāreṇa yo
dehagato'ntaryāmī tat tad devatārūpeṇa vividho bhāti | yathā vāyuḥ
pārthivaṃ guṇaṃ campakādigandhabhedam āśritya nānāgandhavān vibhāti
reṇor guṇaṃ dhūsaratvādikam āśritya nānārūpavān pratīyate tadvat tasyaiva
tat tad devatārūpeṇa phaladātṛtvāt sa īśvara eva me manorathaṃ satyaṃ
karotu kim antargaḍubhir devatāntarair ity arthaḥ | tad uktaṃ gītāsu—

yo yo yāṃ yāṃ tanuṃ bhaktaḥ śraddhayārcitum icchati |

tasya tasyācalāṃ śraddhāṃ tām eva vidadhāmy aham |

sa tayā śraddhayā yuktas tasyārādhanam īhate |

labhate ca tataḥ kāmān mayaiva vihitān hi tān || iti |

ye yathā māṃ prapadyante tāṃs tathaiva bhajāmy aham ||  iti ceti |

kramasandarbhaḥ : nanu vibhūtikāmasya tava
tattadvibhūtisaṃvalitagaṇapatyādyupādhitvenaiva mamopāsanā yuktā,
kathaṃ sarvātmanā nirupādhitvena stauṣi ? tatrāha—yaḥ prākṛtair iti |
tatra tatrānilavat svakāryakaratvaṃ bhavata eva na tūpādher iti sthite
kim upādhibhāvanayeti bhāvaḥ ||34||

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ na yasya sakhyaṃ [bhā.pu. 6.4.24] ity anena, sarvaṃ
pumān veda guṇāṃś ca tajjño na veda sarvajñam anantam īḍe [bhā.pu.
6.4.25] ity anena ca, jīveśvarayor alpajñatvasarvajñatvābhyāṃ vāstavam
eva pārthakyam avadhāritam eva | tataś ca yadoparāmo manasaḥ [bhā.pu.
6.4.26] ity anena, manīṣiṇo'ntarhṛdi [bhā.pu. 6.4.27] ity anena ca
tasyaiveśvarasyaikasyāpy alaukikanirviśeṣasaviśeṣajñānagamyatvena
nirviśeṣaṃ saviśeṣasvarūpaṃ ca yathāmati vyañjitam |

punaś ca sa vai samāśeṣa [bhā.pu. 6.4.28] iti trayeṇa māyikavastūnāṃ
tadrūpatve'pi tatsvarūpabhūtatvābhāva uktaḥ | punar astīti nāstīti
[bhā.pu. 6.4.31] dvayena bhaktiśāstrajñānaśāstrayor avirodho gūḍho'pi
spaṣṭīkṛtaḥ | idānīṃ ye jīveśvarayoḥ pārthakyam upādhikṛtam eva, na
vāstavam ity ācakṣate | teṣāṃ jñānimāninām asamañjasapathagāmitvaṃ
vyañjayan svamanorathasiddhiṃ prārthayate | yaḥ prākṛtair arvācīnair
jñānamārgair janānāṃ dehagataṃ yathāśayam āśayam antaḥkaraṇaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ
śiṣṭaṃ vā anatikramya taddharmākrānta eva vibhāti jīvarūpeṇa bhāsate,
yathā vāyuḥ pārthivaṃ duṣṭaṃ śiṣṭaṃ vā gandham āśritya nānāgandhavān
bhavati, na tu vastutaḥ ||33||

