 || 6.9.11 ||

 hataputras tatas tvaṣṭā juhāvendrāya śatrave |

indraśatro vivardhasva mā ciraṃ jahi vidviṣam ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad āha—indraśatro vivardhasveti | atra
cendraśatrupadasyādyudāttatvāt bahuvrīhau prakṛtyā pūrvapadam iti
smṛter bahuvrīhilakṣaṇāpattyā indra eva tasya śatrur abhūt | tad uktaṃ
śrutyā, yad abravīt svāhendraśatro vardhasveti tasmād asyendraḥ śatrur
abhavat iti | tathā ca śikṣāyaṃ—

mantro hīnaḥ svarato varṇato vā

mithyāprayukto na tam artham āha |

sa vāgvajro yajamānaṃ hinasti

yathendraśatruḥ svarato'parādhāt || iti |

anvāhāryapacanād dakṣiṇāgneḥ ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : indraśatro! vivardhasveti | śatrur hantā | tatra
tatpuruṣe vṛtrasya hantṛtvam | bahuvrīhau satīndrasya hantṛtvam āyāti |
tatra ca tatpuruṣatvaṃ samāsasya cety anena
samāsāntasvarasyāntodāttavidhinā vyajyate | bahuvrīhitvaṃ tu
tadbādhakena bahuvrīhau prakṛtyā pūrvapadam ity anena pūrvapade
svabhāvasiddhādyudāttasthāpakena vyajyate | indraśabdo hy ādyudāttaḥ,
idi paramaiśvarya ity asyodāttagaṇapaṭhitatvāt | tad evaṃ
daivādādyudāttatvapāṭhena vaiparītyaṃ jātam itīndra eva tasya śatrur
abhūt ||11||

viśvanāthaḥ : saṃvatsarānte tad agham iti pūrvoktir āśvinamāsārambhe
indor yadaiva brahmahatyāto vimukto babhūva tadaiva tapovanād āgatya
svīyam āvinamāsaṃ sampālayituṃ pravṛttaḥ tvaṣṭā svaputravadhaṃ śrutvā
krodhaśokābhyām indravadhopāyaṃ cakārety āha hataputra iti | indrāya
śatrave indrarūpaṃ śatruṃ hantuṃ tatra mantram āha—indraśatro
vivardhasveti | indrasya śatruḥ san vivardhasveti samāsasya
vivakṣitatve'pīndra eva śatrur yasyeti babhuvrīhyartha eva daivād
āpatitaḥ svaravyatikramāt | tathā hīdi paramaiśvarya ity
asyodāttagaṇapaṭhitatvāt | indraśabdo hy ādyudāttaḥ tatra samāsasya
ceti sūtreṇa samāsamātra evāntodāttatvavidhānāt tatpuruṣe śeṣam
anudāttam ity anena | indraśatro ity asyādyudāttatvam | bahuvrīhau
prakṛtyā pūrvapadam iti tadbādhakasūtreṇa pūrvapadasya
svabhāvasiddhasvarasthāpanād bahuvrīhāv indraśatro ity
asyādyudāttatvam | tvaṣṭā tu daivād ādyudāttasvaratayaiva pāṭhād indra
eva tasya śatrur hantā abhūt | tad uktaṃ śrutyā—yad abravīt
svāhendraśatro vardhasveti tasmād asyendraḥ śatrur abhavat iti | tathā ca
śikṣāyaṃ—

mantrahīnaḥ svarato varṇato vā

mitho prayukto na tam artham āha |

yathendraśatruḥ svarato'parādhāt

sa vāg vajro yajamānaṃ hi hinasti || iti ||11||

