paribhāvitaḥ suśīlitaḥ parisphuṭo yaḥ pāramahaṃsyadharmo
bhagavadbhajanaṃ, tenodghāṭitaṃ tamorūpaṃ kapāṭaṃ yasmin, tasmin
dvārabhūte citte apāvṛte prakaṭe ātmaloke pratyagrūpe svayam
