ākṣeptuṃ solluṇṭham āhuḥ—atheti | tatra sṛṣṭyādau karmaṇi devadattavat
saṃsārijīvaviśeṣavad avidyayā guṇavisargapatitaḥ san
svakṛtaśubhāśubhayoḥ phalaṃ devatiryagādyavatārarūpam upādatte | āho
svid athavā tadvad devadattarūpatve'pi vidyayātmārāmaḥ sann ityādi
||34||

viśvanāthaḥ : śiṣṭānāṃ pālanaṃ hi duṣṭānāṃ saṃhāraṃ vinā na bhavatīty
antarbhūtasaṃhārakasya pālanasyāpi durjñeyatvam āhuḥ—atheti | devadattaḥ
prākṛtajīvo yathā gṛhādikaṃ nirmāya tatra mitraśatrūdāsīnādigahane
saṃsāre praviśya svakṛtadharmādharmaphalaṃ sukhaduḥkhaṃ bhuṅkte,
tathaiva tatra bhavān ity ādare tvam api guṇebhyaḥ sattvarajastamobhyo
vividhaṃ sargo yeṣāṃ teṣu guṇavisargeṣu devāsurarākṣasādiṣu
parasparavighātiṣu madhye patitaḥ upendrakṛṣṇarāmāvatāreṣu
śiṣṭapālanaduṣṭanigrahayoḥ pravṛttaḥ, bhogaiśvaryasukhaṃ
saṅgrāmādiśramaduḥkhaṃ ca yat prāpnoṣi, tat kiṃ pāratantryeṇa
karmādhīnatvena svakṛtayoḥ puṇyapāpayoḥ kuśalākuśalaṃ sukhaduḥkham
upādadāti svīkaroti, āho svit kiṃ vā samañjasadarśanaḥ
apracyutacichaktikaḥ | udāste sākṣitvān na sukhaṃ duḥkhaṃ svīkarotīti na
vidāmaḥ, tattvaṃ na vidmaḥ ||34||

—o)0(o—

 || 6.9.35 ||

  na hi virodha ubhayaṃ bhagavaty aparimitaguṇagaṇa
īśvare'navagāhyamāhātmye'rvācīnavikalpavitarkavicārapramāṇābhāsakutarkaśāstrakalilāntaḥkaraṇāśrayaduravagrahavādināṃ
vivādānavasara uparatasamastamāyāmaye kevala evātmamāyām antardhāya ko
nv artho durghaṭa iva bhavati svarūpadvayābhāvāt.

madhvaḥ : uparatasamastamāyāmaye | prākṛtasvabhāvavarjite | kevalaṃ
svātmamāyāṃ nijasāmarthyam | svarūpadvayābhāvād ityādisamādhānam |
svatantraḥ paratantro vājño'jño duḥkhī sukhī nu kim | ityādi saṃśayaḥ
kasyājñānināṃ puruṣe |

tasyānantaguṇatvāt pūrṇaśaktitvāc ca hareḥ |

svātantryādikam evāsya vido jānanti niścayāt |

ghaṭakatvād durghaṭasya durjeyatvāc ca sarvaśaḥ |

tacchakter avido jīvaṃ paratantraṃ vadanty amum |

evaṃ durghaṭayā śaktyājño'jñānāṃ parameśvaraḥ ||35||

śrīdharaḥ :  tad evaṃ virodhena durjñeyatvam ukvā tatparikāreṇa
jñānaprakāram āhuḥ—na hīti | virudhyata iti virodhaḥ | ubhayaṃ na
viruddham ity arthaḥ | na hy anyadṛṣṭāntena tvayi vikalpo
yujyate'tarkyaiśvaryatvād ity āhuḥ—bhagavatīti | aparimitā guṇagaṇa yasya
tasminn īśvare svatantre'navagāhyam atarkyaṃ māhātmyaṃ yasya tasmin |
vikalpa evam evaṃ veti, vitarkaḥ kim atra yuktam iti, vicāra ittham eveti
| tatra pramāṇābhāsās tadanugrāhakāḥ | kutarkāś cārvācīnā
vastusvarūpāsaṃsparśino ye vikalpādayaḥ, te yeṣu śāstreṣu, taiḥ kalilaṃ
vyākulam antaḥkaraṇam āśrayo yasya duravagrahasya, tena vādināṃ
vivādasyānavasare 'gocare |

nanu śraddhāmātram etat, yuktir ucyatām | tatrāhuḥ—uparato māyāṃ yaḥ
saṃsāro yasmin, tasmin kevale'py ātmamāyāṃ madhye nidhāya, ko nv arthaḥ
kartṛtvādir na saṃbhavati | yadi vastutaḥ kartṛtvādi bhavet, tarhi
virodhaḥ syāt, na tu tad astīty āhuḥ—svarūpadvayābhāvād iti ||35||

caitanyamatamañjuṣā : etad eva dūre darśayati—na hi virodha ubhayam
ityādi | svarūpadvayābhāvāt, vastutas tu ekam eva rūpam | athavā svarūpe
dvayābhāvāt, svarūpaṃ tāvad ekam eva bhavati, tat tu śrīkṛṣṇākhyam eva |
anyat tu tadīyam eva | Áyad yad bhavasi, śrīkṛṣṇarūpa eva tvam, tat tad
anugrahaṇe'pi bhavān avaśiṣṭa eva, tvaṃ nitya eva, tā api nityā ity
ubhayaviruddham api tvayi na virodhaḥ | tatra hetavaḥ—bhagavatītyādīni
viśeṣaṇāni | svarūpadvayābhāvād iti pṛthak hetūpanyāsaś ca ||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yatra vidyā sambhāvyate tatrāvidyāpi sambhāvitā syād
iti māyāśaktivṛttividyāśaktimayeśvaravādinām upahāsārtham idam
uktavantaḥ | svamataṃ punaḥ sphūrtim abhinayanta ivāhuḥ—na hīti | ubhayam
apīdaṃ viruddhaṃ bhagavati naiva vidyate | tatra hetuḥ—svarūpadvayābhāvāt
| saṃsārijīvavadbaddhatvamuktatvāvasthāviśeṣābhāvāt | baddhatve hi
muktatvaṃ tathā divyātidivyatattadavatārādilakṣako'py artho durghaṭo
na bhavati | yataḥ ātmamāyāṃ nijecchāśaktim antardhāya madhye nidhāya
tatra tatra sahāyatvena sampādya tiṣṭhati satīty arthaḥ | ubhayatra hetavo
bhagavatītyādayaḥ ||35||

viśvanāthaḥ : virodham uktvā bhaktānāṃ mate tasya parihāram āhuḥ—na hīti |
viruddhyata iti virodhaḥ | ubhayam ātmārāmatvam aprākṛtasukhaduḥkhitvaṃ
ca tvayi na viruddham ity arthaḥ | na hy anyadṛṣṭāntena tvayi vikalpo
yujyate, atarkyaiśvaryatvād ity avirodhe hetum āhuḥ—bhagavatītyādi |
prathamaṃ sukhaduḥkhitvaṃ bhagavatīpadadvayenāhuḥ—bhagavatīti |
jñānaśaktibalaiśvaryavīryatejāṃsy aśeṣataḥ bhagavacchabdavācyāni
vinā heyair guṇādibhir iti vaiṣṇavokter
aprākṛtajñānādiṣaḍaiśvaryavattvenājñānamūlakaṃ sarvam eva prākṛtaṃ
sukhaduḥkhaṃ tvayi nāstīty avagatam |

nanu tarhy anye sukhaduḥkhe mayi kutastye ? tatrāhuḥ—apariguṇitaguṇānāṃ
premavaśyatvabhaktavātsalyādīnāṃ gaṇā yasmin, tena hy
asurarākṣasādibhyas tvadbhaktānāṃ prahlādavibhīṣaṇādīnāṃ
pāṇḍavayādavādīnāṃ nityapārṣadānāṃ sādhakabhaktānām apy anantānāṃ
bhaktābhāsāanām asmadādidevānāṃ ca kaṣṭe vṛtte sati,
tattadduṣṭasaṃhārārthavividhaprayāsajñāpitasya tvadīyaduḥkhasya
tathā teṣām eva tattadvipaduttīrṇānām avagrahajājjvalyamānasasyānāṃ
kādambinī vṛṣyamāṇāmṛtasiktānām iva labdhabhavaddarśanānāṃ paramasukhe
vṛtte saty adbhutasya tava sukhasya ca
bhaktavātsalyapremavaśyataikanidānatvād aprākṛte eva te sukhaduḥkhe
bhavataḥ |

kiṃ ca, sukhaduḥkhe api te cinmayasukharūpe eva premnaś
cicchaktisāravṛttitvāt | kiṃ punar vrajadevyādīnāṃ vaidehyāś ca
sambhogavipralambhajanite sukhaduḥkhe | te tu
premaparamakāṣṭhāmayatvāt paramasukharūpe eva staḥ | tataś ca
citsvarūpasya tava citsvarūpayoḥ sukhaduḥkhayoḥ ramamāṇasyātmārāmatvaṃ
sukhaduḥkhavattvam aikyād aviruddham eva pratipāditam |

nanv evaṃ kair api dārśanikair nāhaṃ nirūpye ? tatrāhuḥ—īśvare tvayi
īśitavyānāṃ teṣāṃ nirūpaṇāyogyatā yuktaiveti bhāvaḥ | yato''navagāhyam,
bhaktyāham ekayā grāhya iti tvadvacanāt teṣāṃ bhaktihīnānām
avagāhanārhaṃ māhātmyaṃ yasmin |

nanu yuṣmatpratipādite yat ṣaḍaiśvaryāṇāṃ premnaś ca cinmayatve tair
bahvya evānupapattaya udgṛhyante ?
tatrāhuḥ—arvācīnavastusvarūpāsaṃsparśino vikalpādayo yeṣu śāstreṣu, taiḥ
kalilaṃ vyākulaṃ yad antaḥkaraṇam evam evaṃ veti, vitarkaḥ kim atra yuktam
iti, vicāra ittham eveti | tatra pramāṇābhāsās tadanugrāhakāḥ | kutarkāś
cārvācīnā vastusvarūpāsaṃsparśino ye vikalpādayaḥ, te yeṣu śāstreṣu, taiḥ
kalilaṃ vyākulam antaḥkaraṇam āśayaḥ, tatra āśerate sadaiva śayitvā
tiṣṭhanti ye duravagrahā durāgrahāḥ, tair eva vādināṃ nānāvādodgrāhavatāṃ
vivādasyānavasare agocare | tatra vikalpa evaṃ vā evaṃ vety ākāraḥ
vitarkaḥ, kim atra yuktam ity aniścayaḥ | vicāra ittham eveti niścayaḥ |
tatra pramāṇābhāsāḥ kutsitās tarkā iti |

nanu anupapattau satyāṃ kuto vivādābhāvaḥ ? tatrāhuḥ—uparatāḥ samastā
māyāmayāḥ māyikāḥ padārthā yatra tasminn iti vivādānāṃ
māyāśaktikāryatvāt tava tu māyāmāyikapadārthātiriktavastutvāt kuto
vivādaprasaktisambhāvanāpīty arthaḥ |

nanu tad api yuṣmatsāhāyyathārthaṃ samudramanthanādau
pāṇḍavasāhāyyathārthaṃ sārathyadūtyādau yādavapālanārthaṃ
jarāsandhādyupadravotthabhayapalāyanādau karmaṇi pratyakṣata eva
sarvair dṛśyamānaṃ madīyaduḥkhaṃ kathaṃ cinmayasukharūpaṃ bhaved ity
ata āhuḥ—kevale evetyādi | tvayi māyāśaktivinābhūte saty eva yā
ātmamāyā acintyayogamāyā tām antardhāya madhye kṛtvā ko nu artho
durghaṭa iti tvadanubhave sukhamaye kaḥ praveṣṭuṃ śaknuyād it nātra
pratyakṣādipramāṇaṃ pravartata iti bhāvaḥ | acintyāḥ khalu ye bhāvā na
tāṃs tarkeṇa yojyayed iti vacanāt |

nanv alam acintyaśaktisvīkāreṇa mama bhagavatsvarūpeṇa
bhaktavātsalyotthasukhaduḥkhādimattvaṃ brahmasvarūpeṇa sarvatra
tāṭasthyād ātmārāmatvam iti svarūpadvayasya krameṇa dharmadvayam astu ?
tatrāhuḥ—svarūpadvayābhāvād iti | ekasyaiva bhagavatas tava
nirviśeṣajñānagamyatvam eva brahmatvam alaukikaviśeṣajñānagamyatvam
eva bhagavattvam iti dūravartibhir jñānibhir
alaukikaviśeṣagrahaṇāsamarthais tvam eva brahmasamīpavartibhir bhaktair
alaukikaviśeṣagrahaṇasamarthair bhagavān iti tvam evocyase ity arthaḥ |
tava kṛpāyāḥ paramāṇutvaparamamahattve eva dūratvasamīpatvayor hetū
jñeye ||35||

