 || 6.9.36 ||

 samaviṣamamatīnāṃ matam anusarasi yathā rajjukhaṇḍaḥ sarpādidhiyām.

madhvaḥ : yathā rajjuḥsarpadhiyā rajjubuddhyā gamyate |

tathā yathārthabuddhyā ca mithyā buddhyāvagamyate |

svecchayaiva mahāviṣṇuḥ phalādaś cānusārataḥ || iti tantrabhāgavate
||36||

śrīdharaḥ :  anugrahanigrahādikaṃ tu tattanmatibhedena tvanmāyayā
tvayi sphuratīty āhuḥ—samā viṣamā ca matir yeṣāṃ, teṣāṃ matam abhiprāyam |
sarpādiviṣayā dhīr yeṣāṃ, teṣāṃ yathā rajjukhaṇḍas tathā tathā bhāti |
yad vā, tam evāvirodhaṃ puruṣam atibhedena darśayati—samaviṣameti ||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tarhi katham anyathā pratītir bahirmukhānām ?
tatrāhuḥ—sameti | aniścitabuddhīnām ity arthaḥ | tad eva sthāpayituṃ
jīvanmuktād vailakṣaṇyam āhuḥ—sa eva hīti ||36||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, tad api saṃsāra.paramā siddhyarthaṃ teṣām
abhaktānāṃ mataṃ naivocchannīkaroṣīty āhuḥ—samā brahmaviṣayatvāt viṣamā
tatprātikūlyavattvāc ca matir yeṣām | yad vā, svarūpabhūtābhyām
brahmatvabhagavattvābhyām same'pi ekarūpe'pi tvayi viṣamā māyātītasya
brahmaṇa eva māyāśāvalye sati bhagavattvam ity evaṃ vaiṣamyavatī matir
yeṣāṃ matam anusarasi prāpnoṣi | matam evāhuḥ—sarpādidhiyāṃ rajju khaṇḍa
iva brahmaṇy ātmārāmatvam eva satyaṃ bhaktavātsalyādīnāṃ tu
māyāpratyāyitatvād amūlakaṃ sukhaduḥkhādikam alīkam eveti naivāsti
virodha iti ||36||

