 || 6.9.37 ||

sa eva hi punaḥ sarvavastuni vastusvarūpaḥ sarveśvaraḥ
sakalajagatkāraṇakāraṇabhūtaḥ sarvapratyagātmatvāt
 sarvaguṇābhāsopalakṣita eka eva paryavaśeṣitaḥ.

śrīdharaḥ :  tad evaṃ virodhaṃ parihṛtya niścitaṃ paramārtham āhuḥ, sa eva
hi nānārūpeṇa pratītaḥ | vastusvarūpaḥ sadrūpaḥ | sarveṣāṃ guṇānāṃ
viṣayāṇām ābhāsaiḥ prakāśair upalakṣitaḥ | nanu tair jīva evopalakṣyate ?
na, sarvapratyagātmatvāt sarvajīvāntaryāmitvāt | jaḍatādātmyādhyāsena
jīvasyāpi jaḍaprāyatvān na tena vinā prakāśa iti bhāvaḥ | paryavaśeṣito
“neti neti” ityādiśrutibhiḥ ||37||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : yasmād evaṃ, tasmāt sarvajñamatam apahāya
tadbhaktasammataṃ matam eva vayam anusarāma ity āhuḥ—sa eva
pūrvoktabhagavattvādiviśeṣeṇa viśiṣṭa eva vastusvarūpaḥ |
vāstavavastusvarūpaḥ sarveṣāṃ pratyagātmatvāt indriyāgocaratvāt
apratyakṣo'pi sarveṣāṃ guṇānāṃ buddhīndriyādīnām ābhāsaiḥ prakāśair upa
ādhikyena lakṣitaḥ jñātaḥ, anumita ity arthaḥ | yad uktaṃ guṇaprakāśair
anumīyate bhavān [bhā.pu. 10.2.35] iti | paryavaśeṣito
māyāmāyikavastumātraniṣedhena “neti neti” ityādiśrutibhir iti
bhāgavatāmṛtadṛṣṭāḥ | vinā śārīraceṣṭatvaṃ vinā bhūmyādisaṃśayam | vinā
sahāyāṃs te karmāvikriyasya sudurgamam ity ādyāḥ kārikāḥ anusṛtya
duravabodha ityādīni vyākhyāni ||37||

—o)0(o—

 || 6.9.38 ||

 atha ha vāva tava mahimāmṛtarasasamudravipruṣā sakṛd avalīḍhayā
  svamanasi niṣyandamānānavaratasukhena
 vismāritadṛṣṭaśrutaviṣayasukhaleśābhāsāḥ paramabhāgavatā ekāntino
  bhagavati sarvabhūtapriyasuhṛdi sarvātmani nitarāṃ nirantaraṃ
 nirvṛtamanasaḥ katham u ha vā ete madhumathana punaḥ svārthakuśalā hy
  ātmapriyasuhṛdaḥ sādhavas tvaccaraṇāmbujānusevāṃ visṛjanti na yatra
punar ayaṃ saṃsāraparyāvartaḥ.

śrīdharaḥ :  atas tvadbhaktir eva paramapuruṣārtha ity āhuḥ—atha
hetyādi paryāvarta ity antena | yasmād evaṃbhūtas tvaṃ parameśvaraḥ |
atha ha vāva, ata eva hi | he madhumathana ! paramabhāgavatā ete
tvatpādāmbhojānusevāṃ kathaṃ muhur muhur visṛjantīty anvayaḥ | hi yasmāt
| svārthe puruṣārthe kuśalā nipuṇāḥ | ata eva ātmā tvam eva priyaḥ suhṛc
ca yeṣāṃ te sādhavo rāgādiśūnyāḥ |

tatra hetuḥ—tava mahimaivāmṛtarasasamudras tasya vipruṣā bindumātreṇa
sakṛd avalīḍhayā āsvāditayā svamanasi niṣyandamānam atiśayena sravad yan
nirantaraṃ sukhaṃ, tena vismāritā dṛṣṭaśrutaviṣayāḥ sukhaleśābhāsā
yeṣāṃ te | ata eva bhagavati tvayi nitarāṃ nirantaraṃ nirvṛtaṃ ca mano
yeṣāṃ te yatra yasyām anusevāyāṃ satyām ||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evaṃ bahirmukhān ākṣipya tadbhaktān stuvanti—atha
heti ||38||

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ bahirmukhān ākṣipya tadbhaktān stuvanti—atha heti
| sakṛd apy avalīḍhayā āsvāditayā janitena sukhena premānandena ekāntinaḥ
tatsevaikatānamānasatvāt devarṣyādīn anupāsīnāḥ, tad api devarṣyādayas
teṣu bahutaram eva prasīdantīty āhuḥ—sarveṣāṃ bhūtānāṃ priyasuhṛdi
sarveṣām ātmani ceti | tvatsevāyāṃ satyāṃ te sarve'pi sevitā eva babhūvur
iti bhāvaḥ | svārthakuśalā iti | tvena tvatsevātyāginaḥ
kuyogiprabhṛtayaḥ svārthaghātina eveti bhāvaḥ ||38||

—o)0(o—

 || 6.9.39 ||

  tribhuvanātmabhavana trivikrama trinayana trilokamanoharānubhāva
 tavaiva vibhūtayo ditijadanujādayaś cāpi teṣām upakramasamayo'yam iti
svātmamāyayā suranaramṛgamiśritajalacarākṛtibhir yathāparādhaṃ daṇḍaṃ
daṇḍadhara dadhartha evam enam api bhagavan jahi tvāṣṭram uta yadi
manyase.

madhvaḥ : trinayano nṛsiṃharūpī | viṣṇor nṛsiṃhanāmāni trinetrogrādikāni
tu iti śabdanirṇaye | vividhaṃ bhāvapātratvāt sarve viṣṇor vibhūtayaḥ
iti ca ||39||

śrīdharaḥ :  prastutaṃ vijñāpayanti—tribhūvanetyādinā yāvat samāpti |
tribhuvanam ātmā svarūpaṃ bhavanaṃ ca yasya | tribhuvanasyātmā bhavanaṃ
ceti vā | trayo vikramā yasya | trīn lokān nayatīti tathā trayāṇāṃ lokānāṃ
manoharo'nubhāvo yasya | evaṃ caturdhā saṃbodhyāhuḥ—teṣām
anupakramasamaya bhavanaṃ ceti vā | trayo vikramā yasya | trīn lokān
nayatīti tathā trayāṇāṃ lokānāṃ manoharo'nubhāvo yasya | evaṃ caturdhā
saṃbodhyāhuḥ, teṣām anupakramasamaya udyamakālo na bhavatīti matvā he
daṇḍadhara, pūrvaṃ yathā daṇḍaṃ dadhartha dhṛtavān asy evam enaṃ tvāṣṭram
api jahi, yadi manyase hantuṃ yadīcchasi ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tadbhakteṣu madhye sakāmatvād vayam evātinikṛṣṭā iti
dyotayantaḥ prastutaṃ vijñāpayanti—tribhūvanam ātmabhavanaṃ yāsāṃ
tvadbhaktā devamanuṣyādayo yatra sthitvā tvāṃ sevante tad
idaṃasurākrāntam abhūd iti bhāvaḥ | tribhir vikramais trīn lokān nayasīti
yad eva tribhuvanaṃ vāmanāvatāre tribhir eva pādaiḥ pratigṛhya baleḥ
sakāśād ānīyāsmabhyaṃ dāsyasīti bhāvaḥ | triloketi sampraty api
trilokasthā janās tavānubhāvaṃ paśyantu daityaṃ saṃhareti bhāvaḥ |

nanu parahiṃsāṃ samuddiśya māṃ yajadhve tatrāhuḥ—tavaiva vibhūtayo
