atha bhagavaṃs tavāsmābhir
akhilajagadutpattisthitilayanimittāyamānadivyamāyāvinodasya
sakalajīvanikāyānām antarhṛdayeṣu bahir api ca
 brahmapratyagātmasvarūpeṇa pradhānarūpeṇa ca
 yathādeśakāladehāvasthānaviśeṣaṃ tadupādānopalambhakatayānubhavataḥ
sarvapratyayasākṣiṇa ākāśaśarīrasya sākṣāt parabrahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ
