śrīdharaḥ :  kiṃ ca, asmadabhiprāyas tvayā jñāyata eva | kim atrāsmābhir
vijñāpanīyam ? ity āhuḥ—atha he bhagavan ! tavāsmābhir iha kiyān
vārthaviśeṣo vijñāpanīyaḥ syāt ? ity anvayaḥ | yathā hiraṇyaretaso'gnes
tadaṃśabhūtair visphuliṅgādibhiḥ prakāśo na kriyate, tathā tavāsmābhiḥ
kāryārthaprakāśanaṃ na kāryam ity arthaḥ | atra hetugarbhāṇi
viśeṣaṇāni—akhilajagatām utpattyādiṣu nimittāyamānayā divyamāyayā
vinodo yasya | ata eva sarvajīvanikāyānām antarhṛdayeṣu
brahmasvarūpeṇa pratyagātmāntaryāmī, tadrūpeṇa ca bahir api
pradhānarūpeṇa deśakāladehāvasthānaviśeṣān anullaṅghyānubhavataḥ |
katham ? teṣām upādānatayopalambhakatayā ca, upādānasyopalambhakatayeti vā
| ata eva sarveṣāṃ pratyayānāṃ baddhyādīnām api sākṣiṇaḥ | sākṣitve hetuḥ,
ākāśavad aliptaṃ śarīraṃ svarūpaṃ yasya | aliptatve hetudvayam, sākṣāt
parabrahmaṇo nirupādheḥ paramātmanaḥ śuddhasattvamūrteś ca ||41||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha bhagavann iti sambodhya
brahmaparamātmarūpatve'pi bhagavadrūpatvasyaiva śraiṣṭhyam abhipretam
