arthaḥ | ākāśaśarīrasyeti ā sarvataḥ kāśate virājate yat, tat paraṃ
brahmaiva śarīraṃ yasyety arthaḥ ||41||

viśvanāthaḥ : tava tvayi kiyān arthaviśeṣo vijñāpanīya ity anvayaḥ |
pratyagātmāntaryāmī tadrūpeṇa bahir api viṣayeṣu pradhānaṃ māyā
indriyādikaṃ tadrūpeṇa deśaś ca kālaś ca dehasyāvasthānaviśeṣā
