madhvaḥ : manaso dveṣarāgābhyām puṇyapāpasamudbhavaḥ |

putrādipuṇyapāpābhyām tasmāt sarvaṃ manobhavam || iti nāradīye ||24||

śrīdharaḥ :  manobhavā manomātravijṛmbhitāḥ | atra hetuḥ, arthena
tāttvikasvarūpeṇa vinaiva dṛśyamānāḥ | tat kutaḥ ? yasmāt kṣaṇāntare na
dṛśyante | tāttvikatve hi kṣaṇāntare bādho na syāt | ato
manomātravijṛmbhitatvena svapnādivan mithyābhūtā ity arthaḥ |

nanv ete puṇyāpuṇyakṛtā iti mīmāṃsakāḥ prāhus tat kuto manobhavatvam ?
tatrāha—karmabhiḥ karmavāsanābhir arthān dhyāyataḥ puṃso manasa eva
nimittāt karmāṇy abhavan | pāṭhāntare karma īpsitatamam abhidhyāyata ity
arthaḥ | karmaṇo'pi manobhavattvāt tat sādhyā arthā api manobhavā eveti
bhāvaḥ ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : arthena vyāghrasarpādinā vinaiva dṛśyamānāḥ svapnādibhaṅge
sati na dṛśyante, tad evaṃ dārādayo'vāstavavastubhūtāḥ
svapnādayo'vastubhūtāś ca sarve manobhavāḥ | manobhavatvam
evāha—karmabhiḥ karmavāsanābhir arthān dhyāyataḥ puṃso manasa eva
nimittatvāt karmāṇy abhavan | karm:abhidhyāyata iti pāṭhe karma
īpsitatamam anabhidhyāyata ity arthaḥ | karmaṇo'pi manobhavatvāt
tatsādhyā arthāḥ, tad api manobhavā eveti bhāvaḥ ||24||

