udayādīni tavaiva vibhavo vibhavanaṃ mahimā līleti yāvat | ādiśabdena
praveśaniyamanādīni | viśvasṛjas tu brahmādayo neśvarāḥ kintu te tavāṃśo
yaḥ puruṣas tasyāṃśāḥ | tatra evaṃ sthite'pi pṛthak pṛthag īśvarā vayam
ity abhimānena vṛthaiva spardhante ||35||

