bhavanti, tad api viṣayasādguṇyād bhavantīty āha—jñānātmani cinmaye
aguṇamaye guṇamayāt padārthād bhinne | ato rasakūpapatitaṃ vastu yathā
rasa eva bhaved evaṃ tvayi praviṣṭāḥ kāmadhiyo'pi cinmayyo bhavatīti
