niṣkāmabhakter yat tava jayaḥ pūrvapratipāditas tatrāpi paramakṛpāluḥ
svabhaktavaśībhāvepsus tvam eva kāraṇam ity ato vastutas tavaiva
viśeṣato jaya ity āha—jitam iti | he ajita, bhāgavataṃ dharmam anavadyaṃ
