|| 6.16.52 ||

  loke vitatam ātmānaṃ lokaṃ cātmani santatam |

ubhayaṃ ca mayā vyāptaṃ mayi caivobhayaṃ kṛtam ||

madhvaḥ : lokaṃ cātmani santataṃ vāsanārūpeṇa ||52||

śrīdharaḥ :  atas tam evaṃ paśyety āha—loke bhogyaprapañce bhoktṛtvena
vitatam anugatam ātmānaṃ, lokaṃ cātmani bhogyatvena santataṃ vyāptam | tad
ubhayaṃ ca mayā kāraṇātmanā vyāptam | mayi caivobhayaṃ kṛtaṃ prakalpitaṃ
smared iti tṛtīyenānvayaḥ | paśyed ity adhyāhāro vā ||52||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  tathaivānubhāvayati—loka iti | ātmānaṃ paraṃ brahma
svarūpaṃ vitatam āśrayatvena vartamānam, ātmani tasmin santatam āśritaṃ
paśya mayā bhagavadrūpeṇa parabrahmaṇo'pi
madīyanirviśeṣāvirbhāvarūpatvāt | ata evobhayaṃ ca mayi kṛtaṃ
majjñānanimittam eva nirūpitam ity arthaḥ ||52||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu tvam eva cet sarvaṃ bhavasi, tarhi kiṃ sarvabhūtāny
evopāsyatvena dhyeyāni bhaktānām utāntaryāmyādirūpāṇi ? iti tatrāha—loke
bhogyaprapañce bhoktṛtvena vitatam anugatam ātmānaṃ, jīvaṃ tathā lokaṃ
cātmani bhogyatvena santataṃ savistāram upasthitam | tad ubhayaṃ mayā
kāraṇātmanā vyāptam | mayi cādhiṣṭhānakāraṇe ubhayaṃ kṛtaṃ kāryarūpaṃ
smared iti tṛtīyenānvayaḥ | tena sarvabhūtāni macchaktikāryāṇy anityāny
asvarūpabhūtāni nopāsyatvena dhyeyānīti bhāvaḥ ||52||

