  yathā suṣuptaḥ puruṣo viśvaṃ paśyati cātmani |

ātmānam ekadeśasthaṃ manyate svapna utthitaḥ ||

 evaṃ jāgaraṇādīni jīvasthānāni cātmanaḥ |

māyāmātrāṇi vijñāya taddraṣṭāraṃ paraṃ smaret ||

madhvaḥ : māyāmātrāṇi prakṛtinirmitāni ||54||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu jāgradādyavasthābhedena bhoktṛbhogyātmakaṃ viśvaṃ
sphuṭaṃ pratīyamānaṃ kathaṃ kalpitaṃ syāt ? ity āśaṅkya
svapnagatajāgradādidṛṣṭāntena saṃbhāvayann āha—yatheti dvābhyām |
yathā svapne supto viśvaṃ girivanādirūpaṃ deśāntarastham ātmany eva
paśyati | svapnamadhye suṣuptiṃ svapnaṃ ca paśyatīty arthaḥ | tathā
svapna evotthitaḥ sann ātmaṇam ekadeśasthaṃ śayanadeśe sthitaṃ manyate,
jāgradavasthām anubhavati ||53|| evaṃ prasiddhāny api jāgarādīni
jīvasthānāni jīvopādher buddher avasthābhūtāny ātmano māyāmātrāṇīty
evaṃ vijñāya, teṣāṃ draṣṭāram ata eva paraṃ tadavasthārahitam ātmānaṃ
smaret ||54||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  nanu, yāvad viśvasmād anāsakto na syāt, tāvat kathaṃ
syāt ? ity evam āśaṅkya śuddhajīvasya svarūpajñānapūrvakaṃ tajjñānam
upadiśati—yatheti yugmakena | ayam arthaḥ—yathā svapnamadhya eva suṣuptaḥ
kaścit puruṣaḥ punaḥ svapnaṃ paśyan bhramaviśeṣeṇa viśvaṃ girivanādikam
ātmani paśyati, svasminn evāropayati, punas tasminn eva svapne utthito
labdhajāgara iva san ātmānam ekadeśasthaṃ tatra śayanaikadeśaṃ paśyan
tadgirivanādikaṃ bhinnam eva paśyati, tāni jāgarādīni yathā ātmanaḥ
paramātmano mama māyāmātrāṇi santi, jīvasthānāni vijñāya vijñātasya
puruṣasya śuddhajīvasyāpi draṣṭāraṃ mām eva paraṃ smared iti ||53||

viśvanāthaḥ : pratyuta tāny avāstavavastūni khalv avastūnīva tyaktvā
mamāntaryāmyādirūpam evopāsītety āha—yatheti dvābhyām | svapne
svapnamadhye eva suṣuptaḥ suṣṭhu suptaḥ puruṣaḥ svapnaṃ paśyan
bhramaviśeṣeṇa viśvaṃ girivanādikam ātmani paśyati svasmin evāropayati |
punas tasminn eva svapne utthito labdhajāgaraḥ sann ātmānam
ekadeśasthaṃ tatra śayanaikapradeśasthaṃ manyate, jāgradavasthām
anubhavan, tadgirivanādikaṃ bhinnam eva manyate ity arthaḥ |

tad evam avastubhūtaḥ svāpniko jāgaro yathā tathaiva prasiddho
vastubhūto'pi jāgaro jñeyo naśvaratvād ity āha—evam iti | jīvasthānāni
jīvopādher buddher evāvasthāś ca ātma5 parameśvarasya māyāśaktikāryatvān
māyāmātrāṇi jñātvā teṣāṃ draṣṭāraṃ paraṃ śreṣṭham antaryāmiṇam iti
jīvātmā vyāvṛttaḥ |

atra svāpnikye jāgarasvapnasuṣuptyavasthā avidyayā jīvena sṛjyatvād
avidyāmātryo hy avastubhūtā evaṃ prasiddhā jāgarādyavasthās tu
māyāśaktyā bhagavatā sṛṣṭā māyāmātryaḥ khalv avastubhūtā eva, tathāpi
svāpnikaṃ girivanasarpavyāghrahastyaśvādikas tv avidyayā jīvena
sṛjyam avastv eveti vivecanīyam ||53||

