|| 6.16.55 ||

 yena prasuptaḥ puruṣaḥ svāpaṃ vedātmanas tadā |

sukhaṃ ca nirguṇaṃ brahma tam ātmānam avehi mām ||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu teṣāṃ draṣṭāram iti katham ucyate, svāpe dṛśyābhāvena
draṣṭṛtvābhāvāt tatrāha—yeneti | prasuptaḥ puruṣo jīvo yena rūpeṇa tadā
svāpakāle ātmanaḥ svāpaṃ nirguṇam atīndriyaṃ sukhaṃ ca veda tam ātmānaṃ
brahma mām avehi | tadā svāpasukhayor asaṃvedane “sukham aham asvāpsam”
iti smṛter asaṃbhavāt ||55||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  tam eva spaṣṭayati—yeneti | māyikāhaṅkārālaye
jīvādigatamahācicchaktyaṃśena tattvaviśeṣeṇa hetunā svāpaḥ tatra
nirguṇasukhaṃ ca veda, tad brahmāvehi | ātmānaṃ paramātmānaṃ māṃ
bhagavadrūpaṃ cāvehi | vadanti tat  tattvavida [bhā.pu. 1.2.11] ity ādeḥ
||55||

viśvanāthaḥ :  nanu taṃ draṣṭāram antaryāmiṇaṃ katham ahaṃ jānāmi ? ity
ata āha—yeneti | prasuptaḥ puruṣo jīvo yadā svāpaṃ veda, tad eva suṣuptāv
ātma5 svasya nirguṇaṃ nirviśeṣaṃ sukhaṃ ca yenaiva hetunā veda, tam
ātmānam antaryāmiṇam avehi | yatraiva guṇair dṛḍhabaddham
āvṛtajñānānandam api jīvaṃ kṛpayā suṣuptau nityam eva guṇān pravilāpya
nirguṇaṃ tadīyaṃ sukhaṃ tam anubhāvayati | sa evāntaryāmī spaṣṭam
evāvagamyatāṃ, na hi taṃ vinā hy asvatantro jīvaḥ svayam eva svabandhanaṃ
vimocya svīyasukhaṃ draṣṭuṃ śaknuyād iti bhāvaḥ | tam antaryāmiṇam eva
nirviśeṣatvena pratītaṃ brahma avehi | brahmaiva saviśeṣaṃ māṃ
bhagavantam avehi | eka evāhaṃ brahma paramātma bhagavān iti trirūpo
bhavāmi, na tu matsvarūpasya dvitvaṃ tritvaṃ vā | yad uktaṃ
devaiḥ—svarūpadvayābhāvāt [bhā.pu. 6.9.36] iti ||55||

