|| 6.16.56 ||

 ubhayaṃ smarataḥ puṃsaḥ prasvāpapratibodhayoḥ |

anveti vyatiricyeta taj jñānaṃ brahma tat param ||

madhvaḥ : pratibodheneti svayam api pratibuddhaḥ suptāv asvapan
vyatiricyeta ||56||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu svāpasākṣiṇā dṛṣṭaṃ kathaṃ jāgradavasthaḥ smaret ? na
hy anyena dṛṣṭam anyaḥ smarati tatrāha—ubhayaṃ prasvāpaṃ pratibodhaṃ ca
smarato'nusandadhataḥ | tayoḥ prasvāpapratibodhayoḥ prakāśakatvena yad
anveti tābhyāṃ vyatiricyeta ca | ekaikāpāye'py anapāyāt | taj jñānaṃ paraṃ
brahma tad eva, na tu bhinnam ity arthaḥ | ato bālye dṛṣṭasya yauvane
smṛtivad avasthāntaratve'pi svāpānandayoḥ smaraṇaṃ ghaṭata iti bhāvaḥ |
tad evaṃbhūtaṃ brahmātmānam avehīty anuṣaṅgaḥ ||56||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  ata eva jīvajñānasyāpi brahmaṇi tātparyam ity
āha—ubhayam iti | tajjñānaṃ śuddhajīvasvarūpaṃ tac ca brahmaṇi
tatparam iti ||56||

viśvanāthaḥ :  nanu svāpasākṣiṇā dṛṣṭaṃ jāgradavasthaḥ kathaṃ “sukham
aham asvāpsam iti smaret ? na hy anyena dṛṣṭam anyaḥ smarati |
tatrāha—ubhayaṃ prasvāpaṃ pratibodhaṃ ca smarato'nusandadhataḥ puṃsas
tayoḥ prasvāpapratibodhayoḥ yad anveti, tābhyāṃ vyatiricyeta,
ekaikāpāye'py anapāyāt | taj jñānaṃ jīva ity arthaḥ | ato bālye dṛṣṭasya
yauvane smṛtivad avasthāntaratve'pi svāpānandayoḥ smaraṇaṃ ghaṭata iti
bhāvaḥ | tat paraṃ tato jīvāt paraṃ brahma, na tu sa eva brahmety arthaḥ |
jīvasya taṭasthaśaktitvena tadrūpatve'pi tasya svarūpaśaktitvābhāvāt |
ato bhinnam eva brahmety arthaḥ ||56||

