alaṃ te nirapekṣāya pūrṇakāma namo'stu te |

mahāvibhūtipataye namaḥ sakalasiddhaye ||

śrīdharaḥ : ādau tāvan namaskāramantrān āha tribhiḥ | tubhyam alaṃ
paryāptam eva sarvaṃ na kiñcid anyaiḥ kṛtyam asti | ataḥ kevalaṃ te
tubhyaṃ namo'stu | paryāptau hetavaḥ—nirapekṣāya he pūrṇakāma
mahāvibhūtipataye lakṣmīpataye | sakalāḥ siddhayo'ṇimādyā yasmiṃs
tasmai ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : te tubhyam alaṃ tavadarthaṃ nānyena prayojanam astīty
arthaḥ ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : alam atiśayena tubhyaṃ nama evāstu | devāntaraṃ yathā
nijaiśvaryasiddhyarthaṃ sevakān apekṣate tathā na tvam ity
āha—nirapekṣāya svābhāvikamahaiśvaryavattvād ity arthaḥ | evaṃ
pūrṇakāmāya te kena naivedyādinā prīṇayāmi | mahāvibhūtipataye tubhyaṃ
kair gṛhodyānagajadāsīnṛtyagītadundubhighoṣavādyaiḥ | evaṃ
sakalasiddhaye svargāpavargapremādisiddhidātre tubhyaṃ
karmajñānayogabhaktyādisādhanagaṇaiḥ kathaṃ prīṇayāmīti bhāvaḥ ||4||

