 || 6.19.5 ||

  yathā tvaṃ kṛpayā bhūtyā tejasā mahimaujasā |

  juṣṭa īśa guṇaiḥ sarvais tato'si bhagavān prabhuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : bho īśa ! yathā yathāvat | tvaṃ kṛpādibhir juṣṭaḥ | anyaiś ca
satyasaṅkalpatvādibhiḥ sarvair guṇaiḥ | tatas tasmāt ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tad api tvatkṛpayā sarvaṃ ghaṭata ity āha—yathā tvaṃ kṛpayā
juṣṭas tathaiva bhūtyādibhiś ca tato heots tvam eva bhagavān asīty anvayaḥ
| ayam arthaḥ—kṛpayā śaktyā juṣṭaḥ sevitaḥ san
bhaktadattatulasīpatramātram apy apekṣyamāṇaḥ aham adya kṣudhārtāsmi
kiñcid dehīti bhaktāya yācamāno'pūrṇakāmo'pi bhavasi, mama gṛhodyānādikaṃ
samprati jīrṇaṃ kva vilasāamīty ādi svapnāntare burvan vibhūtiśūnyo'pi
bhavasi, aṇimādisiddhiyukto'pi bhaktapremarasanayā baddhaḥ kvāpi
gantum api na śaknoṣi tathaiva bhūtyā mahālakṣmyā śaktyā tejasā
sarvānadhīnatayā śaktyā mahimnā vibhūtyā ca ojasā balena sarvair anyaiś ca
satyasaṅkalpatvādibhiś ca sarvatra jagati
nirapekṣatvapūrṇakāmatvādimāṃś ca bhavasīti tvam eva bhagavān tvam eva
prabhur bhajanīya iti bhāvaḥ ||5||

