 || 6.19.6 ||

 viṣṇupatni mahāmāye mahāpuruṣalakṣaṇe |

 prīyethā me mahābhāge lokamātar namo'stu te ||

śrīdharaḥ : mahāpuruṣasya parameśvarasya lakṣaṇāni nirapekṣatvādīni
yasyās tasyāḥ sambodhanam ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  viṣṇupatnīti | mahāmāye parākhyaśaktirūpe | ata
eva mahāpuruṣalakṣaṇe tadekasvarūpe ||6||

viśvanāthaḥ : itthaṃ bhagavantaṃ praṇamya lakṣmīṃ praṇamed ity
āha—viṣṇupatnīti | mahāmāye māyāśabdasya śaktivācitvāt
parākhyaśaktirūpe | ata eva mahāpuruṣasya viṣṇor iva lakṣaṇāni
nirapekṣatvādīni yasyāḥ ||6||

